<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market quiet, no trade-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market quiet, no trade-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not established on a carcass basis, compared with Thursday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Reported sales Friday: none   Week to Date: none</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
